{'symbol': 'EXC', 'date': '2023-02-02 09:30:00', 'title': 'SUMMIT RIDGE ENERGY AND COMED MARK 75TH COMMUNITY SOLAR PROJECT IN NORTHERN ILLINOIS', 'text': "JOLIET, ILL.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--COMED AND SUMMIT RIDGE ENERGY (SRE) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE OPENING OF THE 75TH COMMUNITY SOLAR DEVELOPMENT IN COMED'S SERVICE TERRITORY. THE 2.495 MEGAWATT (MW) SPEEDWAY SOLAR PROJECT 10 MILES SOUTH OF JOLIET, ILL., WILL PROVIDE MORE THAN 350 COMED CUSTOMERS WITH ACCESS TO THE BENEFITS OF SOLAR ENERGY AND SAVINGS ON THEIR ENERGY BILLS."}